Z||000029||GTFiero1||10-28-2001||12:50 PM||||the 2002 Z06 will have 405hp. they can pull 1G on the skid pad.your saying thats over priced? a car that can hit close to 200mph and does 0-60 in just over 4sec? come on. some of yous are paying 40-50 grand for a lambo replica that does 0-60 in 8sec and can hit 120mph.... you guys are nutzoid. id gladly pay 50 grand for Z06 if i had it. what do want it to be 30 grand? i think everyone in the world would want 30 grand for a 12 second super killer. although with the new 405hp engine comming out next year, it'll get even better<P>------------------<BR>Adam J. B.||||reg||1
